    ]
   },
   {
    "claim": "On 09a95ffa (car on time, 0.75x, ego 1.2x), every run failed. After braking behind the slower lead car, the policy steered left into the next lane against a RIGHT command and touched a car coming up from behind. In one run the triage could not say whether the policy was at fault, because the other car clipped the ego's rear corner. At 0.5x car speed with the ego at 1.4x, a single run passed.",
